---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Sponsor AI Tools HQ - Reach 10K+ AI-Focused Developers & Creators"
  description="Advertise on AI Tools HQ. Premium placement in front of developers, marketers, and creators actively researching AI tools. Starting at $49/mo."
>
  <main class="sponsors-page">
    <header class="page-header">
      <div class="badge">Sponsorship</div>
      <h1>Reach Builders Who Buy</h1>
      <p>AI Tools HQ gets 10K+ monthly visitors actively evaluating AI tools — developers, marketers, and creators with budget and intent to purchase.</p>
    </header>

    <section class="stats-row">
      <div class="stat">
        <span class="stat-number">10K+</span>
        <span class="stat-label">Monthly Visitors</span>
      </div>
      <div class="stat">
        <span class="stat-number">139</span>
        <span class="stat-label">Tools Reviewed</span>
      </div>
      <div class="stat">
        <span class="stat-number">High</span>
        <span class="stat-label">Buyer Intent</span>
      </div>
      <div class="stat">
        <span class="stat-number">Dev-First</span>
        <span class="stat-label">Audience</span>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="tiers">
      <h2>Sponsorship Tiers</h2>
      <p class="tiers-sub">All placements are exclusive. One sponsor per slot.</p>

      <div class="tier-grid">
        <div class="tier-card">
          <div class="tier-header">
            <span class="tier-name">Featured Tool</span>
            <div class="tier-price">
              <span class="price">$49</span>
              <span class="per">/mo</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <ul class="tier-features">
            <li>"Featured" badge on your tool's category page</li>
            <li>Priority listing position in category</li>
            <li>Gold border highlight on tool card</li>
            <li>Featured on homepage "Handpicked AI Tools" section</li>
            <li>Link to your affiliate/referral URL</li>
          </ul>
          <div class="tier-note">Best for: Tools already listed on AI Tools HQ</div>
          <!-- TODO: Replace with Stripe Payment Link — create at https://dashboard.stripe.com/payment-links -->
          <a href="mailto:hello@ai-tools-hq.com?subject=Featured Tool - $49/mo&body=Hi, I'm interested in the $49/mo Featured Tool sponsorship. My tool is:" class="tier-cta">Get Featured</a>
        </div>

        <div class="tier-card tier-popular">
          <div class="popular-badge">Most Popular</div>
          <div class="tier-header">
            <span class="tier-name">Verified Sponsor</span>
            <div class="tier-price">
              <span class="price">$199</span>
              <span class="per">/mo</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <ul class="tier-features">
            <li>Everything in Featured Tool</li>
            <li>"Verified Sponsor" badge on tool page</li>
            <li>Featured placement on homepage (above fold)</li>
            <li>Inclusion in weekly newsletter mention</li>
            <li>Category page header placement</li>
          </ul>
          <div class="tier-note">Best for: Tools seeking category authority</div>
          <a href="mailto:hello@ai-tools-hq.com?subject=Verified Sponsor - $199/mo&body=Hi, I'm interested in the $199/mo Verified Sponsor tier. My tool is:" class="tier-cta tier-cta-primary">Become a Sponsor</a>
        </div>

        <div class="tier-card tier-premium">
          <div class="tier-header">
            <span class="tier-name">Top Alternative</span>
            <div class="tier-price">
              <span class="price">$349</span>
              <span class="per">/mo</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <ul class="tier-features">
            <li>Everything in Verified Sponsor</li>
            <li>Exclusive #1 slot on a "[Competitor] alternatives" page</li>
            <li>Dedicated alternatives page targeting your competitor's keywords</li>
            <li>Sponsored case study writeup (500 words)</li>
            <li>Monthly performance report</li>
          </ul>
          <div class="tier-note">Best for: Tools competing against established players (Cursor, Notion, Midjourney, etc.)</div>
          <a href="mailto:hello@ai-tools-hq.com?subject=Top Alternative Sponsorship - $349/mo&body=Hi, I'm interested in the $349/mo Top Alternative sponsorship. My tool competes with:" class="tier-cta">Claim Your Slot</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="audience">
      <h2>Who's Reading</h2>
      <div class="audience-grid">
        <div class="audience-card">
          <span class="audience-icon">💻</span>
          <h3>Developers & Builders</h3>
          <p>Indie hackers, startup engineers, and agency devs evaluating AI APIs, coding tools, and automation platforms.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="audience-card">
          <span class="audience-icon">✍️</span>
          <h3>Content Creators</h3>
          <p>Writers, marketers, and creators looking for AI writing, image generation, and video tools with real reviews.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="audience-card">
          <span class="audience-icon">🚀</span>
          <h3>Startup Teams</h3>
          <p>Product managers and founders comparing tools before committing to annual plans.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="faq-section">
      <h2>Common Questions</h2>
      <div class="faq-list">
        <div class="faq-item">
          <h3>Do you require a minimum commitment?</h3>
          <p>No. Sponsorships are month-to-month. Cancel anytime with 7 days notice.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item">
          <h3>What if my tool isn't in your directory yet?</h3>
          <p>We'll add and review your tool as part of the onboarding. Listing + sponsorship package.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item">
          <h3>Do you disclose sponsored placements?</h3>
          <p>Yes, always. All sponsored listings are labeled "Sponsored" or "Featured Sponsor" per FTC guidelines.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item">
          <h3>Can I sponsor a specific category?</h3>
          <p>Yes — the Verified Sponsor tier includes category-level placement. Popular categories (coding, writing, image gen) go fast.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="cta-box">
      <h2>Ready to get in front of buyers?</h2>
      <p>Email us and we'll confirm your slot within 24 hours.</p>
      <a href="mailto:hello@ai-tools-hq.com?subject=Sponsorship Inquiry" class="btn-primary">Email Us Now</a>
      <p class="cta-sub">Or reach out on X: <a href="https://x.com/AIToolsHQ" target="_blank" rel="noopener">@AIToolsHQ</a></p>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>

<style>
  .sponsors-page {
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 8rem 2rem 4rem;
  }

  .page-header {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }

  .badge {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 0.3rem 1rem;
    background: var(--success-bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--success-border-strong);
    border-radius: 50px;
    color: var(--accent-primary);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .page-header h1 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 3.5rem);
    font-weight: 400;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  .page-header p {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    max-width: 600px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  /* Stats */
  .stats-row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    gap: 1px;
    background: var(--border-subtle);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    border-radius: 16px;
    overflow: hidden;
    margin-bottom: 4rem;
  }

  .stat {
    background: var(--bg-secondary);
    padding: 1.5rem;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .stat-number {
    display: block;
    font-size: 1.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--accent-primary);
    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
  }

  .stat-label {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }

  /* Tiers */
  .tiers h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 2rem;
    font-weight: 400;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .tiers-sub {
    text-align: center;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }

  .tier-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 4rem;
  }

  .tier-card {
    position: relative;
    background: var(--bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    border-radius: 20px;
    padding: 2rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1rem;
    transition: border-color 0.2s;
  }

  .tier-card:hover {
    border-color: var(--white-20);
  }

  .tier-popular {
    border-color: var(--accent-primary);
    background: var(--white-02);
  }

  .tier-premium {
    border-color: var(--accent-glow-strong); /* ds-exception: no purple variable; using accent alternative */
  }

  .popular-badge {
    position: absolute;
    top: -12px;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    background: var(--accent-primary);
    color: var(--bg-primary);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    padding: 0.25rem 1rem;
    border-radius: 50px;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .tier-header {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: flex-start;
  }

  .tier-name {
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    font-size: 1rem;
  }

  .tier-price {
    text-align: right;
  }

  .price {
    font-size: 1.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--accent-primary);
  }

  .per {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
  }

  .tier-features {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    flex: 1;
  }

  .tier-features li {
    padding: 0.4rem 0;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }

  .tier-features li::before {
    content: "✓";
    color: var(--accent-primary);
    font-weight: 700;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .tier-note {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--white-50);
    font-style: italic;
    padding-top: 0.5rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
  }

  .tier-cta {
    display: block;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    border-radius: 50px;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    transition: all 0.2s;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .tier-cta:hover {
    border-color: var(--accent-primary);
    color: var(--accent-primary);
  }

  .tier-cta-primary {
    background: var(--accent-primary);
    color: var(--bg-primary);
    border-color: var(--accent-primary);
  }

  .tier-cta-primary:hover {
    background: var(--accent-secondary);
    color: var(--bg-primary);
  }

  /* Audience */
  .audience {
    margin-bottom: 4rem;
  }

  .audience h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 2rem;
    font-weight: 400;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .audience-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  .audience-card {
    background: var(--bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 1.5rem;
  }

  .audience-icon {
    font-size: 2rem;
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .audience-card h3 {
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .audience-card p {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  /* FAQ */
  .faq-section {
    margin-bottom: 4rem;
  }

  .faq-section h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 2rem;
    font-weight: 400;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .faq-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .faq-item {
    background: var(--bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;
  }

  .faq-item h3 {
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .faq-item p {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  /* CTA */
  .cta-box {
    margin-top: 2rem;
    padding: 3rem;
    background: var(--bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    border-radius: 20px;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .cta-box h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 1.75rem;
    font-weight: 400;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .cta-box > p {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .btn-primary {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 0.875rem 2.5rem;
    background: var(--accent-primary);
    color: var(--bg-primary);
    border-radius: 50px;
    font-weight: 600;
    transition: all 0.3s;
    text-decoration: none;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .btn-primary:hover {
    background: var(--accent-secondary);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  .cta-sub {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }

  .cta-sub a {
    color: var(--accent-primary);
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .sponsors-page {
      padding: 7rem 1.5rem 3rem;
    }

    .stats-row {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }

    .tier-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .audience-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
